{"unit_id":"heartmove__dsh-session-bridge#card-zh","repo":"heartmove/dsh-session-bridge","commit":"f1b3d2b04b0340c31131d088fd40574575a6a348","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-bridge 是面向 DSH Web 与 CLI 的会话管理插件，可让当前代理创建新的主会话、向其他会话发送消息，并等待或读取回复。它通过 DSH 工具接口连接会话和后台监控；支持跨工作区查找与恢复离线会话、查看逐段输出、归档会话，以及在任务停滞或循环时提醒、中断并交接任务。适合需要协调多个 DSH 会话或持续跟进长任务的使用者。需要安装在运行中的 DSH 环境中，不要求额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:26-40","src/tools.ts:725-737","src/tools.ts:807-823"]}
{"unit_id":"heartmove__dsh-session-bridge#card-en","repo":"heartmove/dsh-session-bridge","commit":"f1b3d2b04b0340c31131d088fd40574575a6a348","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-bridge lets DSH users coordinate sessions. It creates sessions, sends messages, waits for replies, finds sessions, and reads output step by step. Its monitor nudges stalled work, detects loops, and hands tasks to a new session. Install in DSH; no extra API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:26-40","src/tools.ts:725-737","src/tools.ts:807-823"]}
